OL,3,GNEWSA'Despicable' theft from hospital
OL,4,Achapel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital is appealing for the return
OL,7,Fof a religious artefact from its chapel
OL,8,Fafter it was apparently seen being
OL,9,Ftaken away in a wheelchair.
OL,11,FWirral's Arrowe Park hospital's
OL,12,Ftabernacle - a large brass urn - was
OL,13,Ftaken shortly after 12:50 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FA man was seen wheeling it away in the
OL,17,Fdirection of the nearby football
OL,18,Fpitches
OL,20,FPolice are now investigating the theft,
OL,21,Fwhich an inspector described as
OL,22,F"despicable".
